{"seq":3,"slug":"lora-and-lpwan","title":"LoRa 与低功耗广域网","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/iot-protocols-and-networking/lora-and-lpwan","wordCount":824,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"lora-与低功耗广域网\">LoRa 与低功耗广域网</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>低功耗广域网（LPWAN）技术专为 IoT 场景设计，以极低功耗实现公里级通信距离。LoRa（Long Range）和 LoRaWAN 是 LPWAN 领域最成功的技术方案——LoRa 是物理层调制技术，LoRaWAN 是基于 LoRa 的 MAC 层协议和网络架构。与之竞争的还有 NB-IoT（蜂窝授权频段）和 Sigfox（超窄带）。LPWAN 技术的核心取舍是用带宽换距离和功耗。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[LPWAN 技术] --&gt; B[非授权频段]&#10;    A --&gt; C[授权频段]&#10;    B --&gt; D[LoRa / LoRaWAN]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Sigfox]&#10;    C --&gt; F[NB-IoT]&#10;    C --&gt; G[LTE-M]&#10;    D --&gt; H[CSS 调制]&#10;    D --&gt; I[星型网络]&#10;    F --&gt; J[蜂窝基础设施]&#10;    F --&gt; K[运营商部署]\">graph TD\n    A[LPWAN 技术] --&gt; B[非授权频段]\n    A --&gt; C[授权频段]\n    B --&gt; D[LoRa / LoRaWAN]\n    B --&gt; E[Sigfox]\n    C --&gt; F[NB-IoT]\n    C --&gt; G[LTE-M]\n    D --&gt; H[CSS 调制]\n    D --&gt; I[星型网络]\n    F --&gt; J[蜂窝基础设施]\n    F --&gt; K[运营商部署]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>频段</th>\n<th>距离</th>\n<th>速率</th>\n<th>功耗</th>\n<th>双向通信</th>\n<th>部署成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LoRa/LoRaWAN</td>\n<td>非授权（ISM）</td>\n<td>2-15km</td>\n<td>0.3-50 Kbps</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>低（自建）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NB-IoT</td>\n<td>授权（蜂窝）</td>\n<td>1-10km</td>\n<td>200 Kbps</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>中（运营商）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sigfox</td>\n<td>非授权（UNB）</td>\n<td>3-50km</td>\n<td>100 bps</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>极有限</td>\n<td>低（订阅）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LTE-M</td>\n<td>授权（蜂窝）</td>\n<td>1-10km</td>\n<td>1 Mbps</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>中（运营商）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"lora-物理层\">LoRa 物理层</h2><h3 id=\"css-调制技术\">CSS 调制技术</h3><p>LoRa 使用啁啾扩频（Chirp Spread Spectrum, CSS）调制，通过线性频率扫描实现高抗干扰能力。扩频因子（Spreading Factor, SF）是 LoRa 最关键的配置参数——SF 越大，通信距离越远但速率越低：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// LoRa 物理层参数配置（SX1276/SX1262）&#10;typedef struct {&#10;    uint32_t frequency;        // 载波频率 (Hz)&#10;    uint8_t  spreading_factor; // 扩频因子 SF7-SF12&#10;    uint8_t  bandwidth;        // 带宽 125/250/500 kHz&#10;    uint8_t  coding_rate;      // 编码率 4/5-4/8&#10;    int8_t   tx_power;         // 发射功率 (dBm)&#10;    uint16_t preamble_length;  // 前导码长度&#10;} lora_config_t;&#10;&#10;lora_config_t config = {&#10;    .frequency = 470000000,       // 470 MHz（中国 ISM 频段）&#10;    .spreading_factor = 10,        // SF10：平衡距离与速率&#10;    .bandwidth = 125,              // 125 kHz&#10;    .coding_rate = 5,              // 4/5 编码率&#10;    .tx_power = 14,                // 14 dBm&#10;    .preamble_length = 8,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// LoRa 物理层参数配置（SX1276/SX1262）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">typedef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> frequency;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 载波频率 (Hz)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  spreading_factor;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 扩频因子 SF7-SF12</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bandwidth;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 带宽 125/250/500 kHz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  coding_rate;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 编码率 4/5-4/8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int8_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   tx_power;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         // 发射功率 (dBm)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint16_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> preamble_length;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 前导码长度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lora_config_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lora_config_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .frequency </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 470000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // 470 MHz（中国 ISM 频段）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .spreading_factor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // SF10：平衡距离与速率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .bandwidth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 125</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              // 125 kHz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .coding_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              // 4/5 编码率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .tx_power </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                // 14 dBm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .preamble_length </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SF</th>\n<th>灵敏度</th>\n<th>空中时间 (10 字节)</th>\n<th>有效速率</th>\n<th>典型距离</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SF7</td>\n<td>-123 dBm</td>\n<td>36ms</td>\n<td>5.47 Kbps</td>\n<td>2-3 km</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SF8</td>\n<td>-126 dBm</td>\n<td>72ms</td>\n<td>3.13 Kbps</td>\n<td>3-5 km</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SF9</td>\n<td>-129 dBm</td>\n<td>144ms</td>\n<td>1.76 Kbps</td>\n<td>5-8 km</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SF10</td>\n<td>-132 dBm</td>\n<td>289ms</td>\n<td>0.98 Kbps</td>\n<td>8-12 km</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SF11</td>\n<td>-134.5 dBm</td>\n<td>577ms</td>\n<td>0.44 Kbps</td>\n<td>10-15 km</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SF12</td>\n<td>-137 dBm</td>\n<td>1155ms</td>\n<td>0.25 Kbps</td>\n<td>15+ km</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"lorawan-网络架构\">LoRaWAN 网络架构</h2><h3 id=\"星型拓扑\">星型拓扑</h3><p>LoRaWAN 采用星型拓扑，终端设备直接与网关通信，网关通过 IP 网络连接到网络服务器：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[终端设备] --&gt;|LoRa| D[网关 1]&#10;    B[终端设备] --&gt;|LoRa| D&#10;    C[终端设备] --&gt;|LoRa| E[网关 2]&#10;    B --&gt;|LoRa| E&#10;    D --&gt;|IP/4G| F[网络服务器]&#10;    E --&gt;|IP/4G| F&#10;    F --&gt; G[应用服务器]&#10;    F --&gt; H[Join 服务器]\">graph LR\n    A[终端设备] --&gt;|LoRa| D[网关 1]\n    B[终端设备] --&gt;|LoRa| D\n    C[终端设备] --&gt;|LoRa| E[网关 2]\n    B --&gt;|LoRa| E\n    D --&gt;|IP/4G| F[网络服务器]\n    E --&gt;|IP/4G| F\n    F --&gt; G[应用服务器]\n    F --&gt; H[Join 服务器]</pre><h3 id=\"设备分类\">设备分类</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// LoRaWAN 设备入网（OTAA 方式）&#10;#include &quot;lora_mac.h&quot;&#10;&#10;static uint8_t dev_eui[] = {0x00, 0x01, 0x02, 0x03, 0x04, 0x05, 0x06, 0x07};&#10;static uint8_t app_eui[] = {0x70, 0xB3, 0xD5, 0x7E, 0xD0, 0x00, 0x00, 0x00};&#10;static uint8_t app_key[] = {0x2B, 0x7E, 0x15, 0x16, 0x28, 0xAE, 0xD2, 0xA6,&#10;                            0xAB, 0xF7, 0x15, 0x88, 0x09, 0xCF, 0x4F, 0x3C};&#10;&#10;void lorawan_join(void) {&#10;    MlmeReq_t req;&#10;    req.Type = MLME_JOIN;&#10;    req.Req.Join.DevEui = dev_eui;&#10;    req.Req.Join.JoinEui = app_eui;&#10;    req.Req.Join.NwkKey = app_key;&#10;    req.Req.Join.Datarate = DR_3;&#10;    LoRaMacMlmeRequest(&amp;req);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 发送传感器数据&#10;void send_uplink(uint8_t *data, uint8_t len) {&#10;    McpsReq_t req;&#10;    req.Type = MCPS_CONFIRMED;  // 确认帧&#10;    req.Req.Confirmed.fPort = 1;&#10;    req.Req.Confirmed.fBuffer = data;&#10;    req.Req.Confirmed.fBufferSize = len;&#10;    req.Req.Confirmed.Datarate = DR_3;&#10;    LoRaMacMcpsRequest(&amp;req);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// LoRaWAN 设备入网（OTAA 方式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"lora_mac.h\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dev_eui</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">00</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">02</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">03</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">04</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><spa